*.egg
# Anchored to the repo root. Unanchored, this pattern also matched
# `curation/src/curation/manifest/` on a case-insensitive filesystem (macOS),
# silently excluding the theme-manifest builder — the only channel between the
# curation and display planes — from every commit. Caught 2026-07-27; guarded by
# tests/test_repo_hygiene.py.
/MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

