# Backlog service export — full-fidelity cutover backup, regenerable via
# `prawduct-hook backlog export`. Tracked copy would duplicate GitHub Issues.
.prawduct/backlog-export/

# Samsung TV pairing token. Untracked 2026-07-27 (issue #4); this entry is now
# live. The leaked token was confirmed expired by the operator, so no re-pair
# was needed. The token's path is now configurable (TV_TOKEN_FILE, defaulting
# under ART_ROOT) rather than a bare relative path, so it no longer depends on
# the process CWD or on living inside the checkout.
token_file

# Legacy catalogue snapshots (issue #4). `all.json` itself stays tracked — it is
# the input to the Chunk 10 seeding path and the mat regression corpus.
all.backup
all.json.backup
all.json.backup2

# Prawduct session files
.prawduct/.handoff-notes.md
